--- !u!114 &1016677364
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1016677358}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1f017b7da47c2e54c9e2a45ca2e0be4c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DigShop
  game: {fileID: 1016677360}
  hud: {fileID: 1997003377}
  spadeNames:
  - Old Spade
  - Garden Spade
  - Steel Spade
  - Fine Steel Spade
  spadePrices: 000000003c000000dc000000e0010000i
  spadeLines:
  - Worn smooth where small hands held it.
  - Sharp enough for clay. Smells of summer gardens.
  - Heavy and sure. Stone gives way to it.
  - It digs as if it already knows the way.
  spadeIcons:
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: a0595279ead4d1142b0fe5779acc70b4, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6ec39352941316f4c923f1ef9d705af1, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6433e05f2098aa24aadb31f3b779d500, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6effb0b7bd066cc4992ae5d9d8b92005, type: 3}
  bagNames:
  - Small Basket
  - Picnic Basket
  - Wooden Bucket
  - Old Suitcase
  bagSizes: 060000000a0000001000000018000000i
  bagPrices: 00000000280000006e000000f0000000i
  bagLines:
  - Just enough for small pockets.
  - It still smells of sandwiches.
  - Heavier than it looks.
  - It has been further than you.
  bagIcons:
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6713727fbf7c80d459622e7e1e6aeac0, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2207b048143c4c645ae7531485462262, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7b6c468a3d174574c970eebd24425341, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: d6327737be1ab924cbfbe9e00686579b, type: 3}
  lanternNames:
  - Small Lantern
  - Bright Lantern
  - Warm Lamp
  lanternPower:
  - 1
  - 1.5
  - 2.1
  lanternPrices: 000000003200000096000000i
  lanternLines:
  - Enough light to see your hands.
  - A wider circle, like a porch light left on.
  - Warm as a kitchen window at night.
  lanternIcons:
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1c6cc8a5c5a6eb442bc22c7bb6a00296, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 33086f11db9fee24096df369dee8cd6b, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 53a41779cdbf1a14ea73b4c680ba8494, type: 3}
  greetings:
  - Mrrp. You're back.
  - Show me what you found.
  - Dirt on your knees again.
  - I kept the counter warm.
  onSell:
  - Shiny. I'll keep these.
  - Good finds.
  - Mm. These will do nicely.
  - The bag feels lighter, doesn't it?
  onBuy:
  - Use it well.
  - That one suits you.
  - Careful with it.
  - Go on, then.
  onPoor:
  - Not yet. Dig a little more.
  - Come back with more stones.
  - A few more, and it's yours.
  onNothing:
  - Your bag is empty.
  - Nothing to sell? Then dig.
  knowing:
  - You used to dig here when you were small. You never got very far.
  - Someone always called you in when it got dark. You never wanted to go.
  - You wrote your name in the wet cement by the back step. It's still there.
  - You're the one who left that window open, every summer.
  - You always say you'll call back. You will, this time.
  - It's later than it looks out here.
